#: ../../source/docs/command-set/Driver_AT_Commands.rst:224
#: ../../source/docs/command-set/Driver_AT_Commands.rst:274
#: 1f8be1faa99c4744bc473882b31e2d35 478a7729d6cf449d93001f67c42fccec
msgid ""
"Ai-WB2 系列模组一共有 5 路 PWM，同时开启时必须注意芯片引脚的 IO 序号对 5 取余不能重复，否则只会有一个生效，例如设置了 "
"IO1/2/6 实际只有 IO2/6生效，IO1 被 IO6 覆盖了"
msgstr ""
"Ai-WB2 series modules provide 5 PWM channels. When enabling multiple channels simultaneously, the IO pin number modulo "
"5 must be unique; otherwise only one takes effect. For example, if IO1/2/6 are configured, only IO2/6 take effect and IO1 "
"is overridden by IO6."

#: ../../source/docs/command-set/Driver_AT_Commands.rst:226
#: ../../source/docs/command-set/Driver_AT_Commands.rst:276
#: 3367258910144df68f9e3feaeb98f0a0 3748e7eb7eb94d09826082acb77f3f2f
msgid ""
"注意：该指令设置的单位是芯片的周期寄存器，相同参数在不同的模组上的效果可能不同，如果在精度可以满足要求的情况下推荐使用 AT+PWMCFGS "
"设置，这个指令相同参数在不同模组上的效果会基本保持一致(不同芯片可能会存在几 us 的差异)"
msgstr ""
"Note: This command sets the chip period register directly; the same parameters may behave differently on different "
"modules. If precision requirements allow, prefer AT+PWMCFGS, which yields consistent results across modules (a few us "
"difference may exist between chips)."

